(39463, 75, 139, '<td valign="top">This photo grew on me.  I didn''t like it at all when I saw it.  I still think the foreground is too dark, and the angle is a bit odd.  I''d rather it was easier to see what''s on the signs.  I really like the clouds and the blue sky in the background though, and I like how some of the arrows seem to be directing you to go for a nice fly.</td>', 'This photo grew on me.  I didn''t like it at all when I saw it.  I still think the foreground is too dark, and the angle is a bit odd.  I''d rather it was easier to see what''s on the signs.  I really like the clouds and the blue sky in the background though, and I like how some of the arrows seem to be directing you to go for a nice fly.', '2002-03-12 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(192175, 71, 714, '<td valign="top">Very creative drew,  I like the reflection.  This is the shot that made me want to register.  I knew this sight was going to be inspirational to me.  Thanks for making the year 2002 a growing exsperience for me with this site.  Hope you win 1st again this week!</td>', 'Very creative drew,  I like the reflection.  This is the shot that made me want to register.  I knew this sight was going to be inspirational to me.  Thanks for making the year 2002 a growing exsperience for me with this site.  Hope you win 1st again this week!', '2003-01-15 17:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(404486, 53, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image.  I like the color of the sign against the color of the background.  I think though that maybe I would like to have the black a bit blacker.  As is, I can see the sign post, but I can also see that the horizon line is tilted slightly.  Overall very nice though.  Worthy of at least one comment. :)</td>', 'This is a very nice image.  I like the color of the sign against the color of the background.  I think though that maybe I would like to have the black a bit blacker.  As is, I can see the sign post, but I can also see that the horizon line is tilted slightly.  Overall very nice though.  Worthy of at least one comment. :)', '2003-08-30 03:50:39.000000', NULL, 0),
